menu "MAO application"

    config MAO_SLEEPY_TIMEOUT_S
        int "Seconds without input before MAO becomes sleepy"
        range 10 3600
        default 600
        help
            Purely visual/application idle state; the chip does not sleep.
            Before this, the character's own energy drive already makes it
            yawn, drowse and doze on its own.

endmenu
